{
  "description": "CityBuilderBoard — isometric SimCity-lite: zone buildings on a 12x12 riverside grid with gold + wood, grow population to 12 to win. game-shell + canvas-2d with live input wiring (PLACE_BUILDING/SELECT_BUILD_TYPE), a build-palette in the HUD, per-type economy, and wandering citizens.",
